VALUES (27374, 'tt0816556', NULL, 'Lake Mungo', 'Lake Mungo', 'movie', 2009, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IaGu8r0t6bBaydkR6z9l9tJsCg.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5eaS62YjA5Z7WPcf4quyZa5VpeO.jpg', 'After 16-year-old Alice Palmer drowns at a local dam, her family experiences a series of strange, inexplicable events centered in and around their home. Unsettled, the Palmers seek the help of a psychic and parapsychologist, who discovers that Alice led a secret, double life. At Lake Mungo, Alice''s secret past emerges.', NULL, NULL, 3.4135, 6.144, 0, 76.6058904109589, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-20 13:26:55')
