VALUES (23685, 'tt0166276', NULL, 'Monkeybone', 'Monkeybone', 'movie', 2001, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgH7Wej9922C1MQv0wciAfesKH8.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ntVB3LgyvKIaw6Dk29ZuDsV3TSR.jpg', 'After a car crash sends repressed cartoonist Stu into a coma, he and the mischievous Monkeybone, his hilarious alter-ego, wake up in a wacked-out waystation for lost souls. When Monkeybone takes over Stu''s body and escapes to wreak havoc on the real world, Stu has to find a way to stop him before his sister pulls the plug on reality forever!', NULL, NULL, 2.2662, 5.3, 0, 2.58486363636363662e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-20 13:26:55')
