VALUES (64210, 'tt0220218', NULL, 'Cyber City Oedo 808', 'サイバーシティ OEDO 808', 'tv', 1990, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TaiOqFMxVPEBGwpdRZbskRgCtY.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b7ZfDgCLoVzulJAOVYFX1LpMtVW.jpg', 'In the city of Oedo 2808 A.D., three Cyber criminals are given two choices, to either rot in jail or to join a special force of the Cyber Police to possibly get one more chance at freedom. For each criminal apprehended, and for each successful mission done, the state will agree to reduce their sentences. Lead by Hasegawa, the new recruits: Sengoku, Gogul, and Benton will bring some hard justice to Oedo, and possibly taste freedom once again.', NULL, NULL, 4.4611, 7.4, 0, 5.91, '2026-08-08 02:23:49', '2026-11-20 13:26:55')
